# Project Aura uses one env file per service:
#
#   backend-node/.env      <- copy from backend-node/.env.example  (API, required)
#   frontend-react/.env    <- copy from frontend-react/.env.example (build-time, optional)
#   ai-python              <- environment variables only:
#                               MODEL_VERSION=v2   (must match the API)
#                               AI_PORT=5000       (dev server only; gunicorn uses -b)
#                               LOG_LEVEL=INFO
#
# See README.md -> "Production deployment".
